T15:49:23Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:47Z","closed_at":"2025-10-28T17:24:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111326","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111326","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111326.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111326.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-28T17:24:50Z"},"body":"The problem: I have my system display scale factor set to 175%. But the Godot editor fails to detect it, the UI is very small and the editor setting says `Auto (100%)`.\r\n\r\nThe editor is currently using a strange way to determine the default scale:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d413181b8a6c427a56d6c37378d4dec8e658b630/editor/settings/editor_settings.cpp#L1832-L1846\r\n\r\nMy screen resolution is 2560x1600 and the DPI reported is 168. So the scale is indeed 100% according to this algorithm.\r\n\r\nAccording to MSDN, the DPI reported by `GetDpiForMonitor(type=MDT_DEFAULT)` shows the correct factor for scaling UI elements (with 96 as 100%). I believe the default scale can be as easy as dividing `screen_get_dpi()` with 96.\r\n\r\nIn this PR, I also:\r\n- optimized `screen_get_dpi()` to avoid enumerating the monitors twice\r\n- changed the error return value of `screen_get_dpi()` from 72 to 96 as it means 100% scale on Windows\r\n- removed an unnecessary optional parameter","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111326/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111326/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}